#: fpdb_3_legacy/update_notice.py
msgid ""
"fpdb can check once a day whether a newer release is available on GitHub, "
"and tell you in the status bar.\n"
"\n"
"The check is a single anonymous request to the GitHub releases page: it "
"sends nothing about you or your hands, and fpdb never downloads or installs "
"anything by itself.\n"
"\n"
"You can change this later in File > Preferences (general: "
"check_for_updates), and check by hand with Help > Check for updates.\n"
"\n"
"Check for updates automatically?"
msgstr ""

